  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -46,6 +46,16 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark insists on subscribing to two dozen streaming services but only watches three.\n \n+* Capture start fails when file set enabled and file extension not supplied if directory contains a period. wsbuglink:14614[].\n+* Cannot drag and move custom filter buttons in toolbar. wsbuglink:19447[].\n+* sshdump fails to connect with private key (ssh-rsa) wsbuglink:19510[].\n+* Can't open a snoop file from the Open dialog box unless I select \"All files\" as the file type. wsbuglink:19565[].\n+* Updater for 4.2.1 hangs. wsbuglink:19568[].\n+* Incorrect recursion depth assert failure when dissecting a legitimate GOOSE message. wsbuglink:19580[].\n+* TFTP dissector bug type listed as netscii instead of netascii doesn't show all TFTP packets including TFTP blocks. wsbuglink:19589[].\n+* ciscodump - older SSH key exchange algorithms not supported. wsbuglink:19594[].\n+* CFLOW: failure to decode 0 length data fields of IPFIX variable length data types. wsbuglink:19605[].\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n@@ -62,6 +72,36 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n // ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.0.11.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+CFLOW\n+CMIP\n+DAP\n+DISP\n+GLOW\n+GOOSE\n+H.225\n+H.245\n+H.248\n+IEEE 1609.2\n+IPv4\n+IPv6\n+ISUP\n+ITS\n+Kerberos\n+LDAP\n+MMS\n+P22\n+P7\n+PARLAY\n+RSVP\n+RTMPT\n+SOME/IP\n+TCP\n+TFTP\n+X11\n+X.509if\n+X.509sat\n+Z39.50\n+ZigBee Green Power\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
